sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant B as Browser/Platform
  participant A as Authenticator
  participant RP as Relying Party

  RP->>B: get() options (challenge, rpId, allow list)
  B->>A: CTAP2 getAssertion
  A-->>B: assertion (sig, flags, counter)
  B-->>RP: clientDataJSON + authData + signature
  RP-->>RP: Verify origin, rpId, signature, counter
